# field-blur (h8-points-field): "3.256" typed into P's x field, then a
# click on the plane — leaving commits, rounded to three decimals in the
# URL and two in the field. Behaviour: the URL "p=3.256", the field "3.26",
# the focus off the slider.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 293 716
wait 150
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
wait 100
type "3.256"
wait 100
click 700 450
wait 400
shot field-blur
